'''Wolfchild Deale''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 6.4 Update|Version 6.4]] and can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Girls & Monsters: Angels of Terror (Gacha Event)|Girls & Monsters: Angels of Terror]] gacha event. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 9.4 Update|Version 9.4]] decreases time between attacks. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 13.0 Update|Version 13.0]], and [[Ultra Talents]] were added in [[Version 14.7 Update|Version 14.7]].

